title: The Paradigm Army — 54 Agents, 272 Notebook Entries
summary: 'Built the complete Paradigm agent army in a single marathon session: 54 specialist agents across 7 tiers (Builders, Reviewers, Strategists, Intelligence, Infrastructure, Meta, Human Ops) with 272 bootstrapped notebook entries from canonical sources. Agents range from core engineering (architect, builder, security) to business (Mozi/Hormozi sales, Leila/operations) to personal (Sunday/secretary, Obi/mentor). Each agent has personality, expertise, attention thresholds, collaboration graphs with named pairs, and transferable patterns. Notebooks bootstrapped from Material Design 3, Apple HIG, WCAG 2.2, Radix Colors, OWASP, Playwright docs, Hormozi methodology, Blender, Godot, and 40+ other canonical sources.'
